WEBVTT

00:35:59.938 --> 00:36:02.166
lumpety-bump up the steps.

00:36:02.190 --> 00:36:04.586
I love paramedics.

00:36:04.610 --> 00:36:07.896
So in they come,
and here's the conversation.

00:36:07.920 --> 00:36:10.817
First paramedic:
"Do you know whose house this is?"

00:36:10.841 --> 00:36:13.416
Second paramedic: "No, whose house is it?"

00:36:13.440 --> 00:36:14.946
First paramedic:

00:36:14.970 --> 00:36:16.766
"It's Margaret Atwood's house."

00:36:16.790 --> 00:36:18.146
Second paramedic:

00:36:18.170 --> 00:36:20.215
"Margaret Atwood? Is she still alive?"

00:36:20.239 --> 00:36:21.756
(Adam laughs)